			<meta property="twitter:description" content="American Veterans Rebuilding is dedicated to the improvement of the American Veteran's Self, Family and Community through Technical Training, Occupational Licensing, Home Ownership Options and Professional Networking."/>
			<meta property="twitter:image" content="/assets/images/logo.avif"/>
